--- Data & Model Files ---

Ignore all large data files

*.csv
*.parquet
*.txt

Ignore saved models (Keras and Pickle)

*.keras
*.h5
*.pkl

--- (IMPORTANT) Exceptions ---

We MUST keep the requirements file

!requirements.txt

Keep any assets inside the app folder

(This un-ignores your favicon.png, styles.css, etc.)

!app/assets/*
!app/assets/image/*

Keep any .txt files inside your app (if you add any)

!app/**/*.txt
dataset/orig/archive.zip
